-- 1) Sub-query “ma” keeps only the needed rows (MA counties, years 2012 & 2017)
--    and the relevant column.
-- 2) Sub-query “pivot” turns the two years into separate columns.
-- 3) Final SELECT calculates the difference (2017 – 2012).
